What will be the output of this code?
int x = 5;
printf("%d", x++);

What will be the output?
int a = 10;
int b = 3;
printf("%d", a % b);

What is the output?
int x = 2;
if(x > 3) printf("A");
else printf("B");

What will be printed?
int a = 5, b = 2;
printf("%d", a / b);

What is the output of the following?
int x = 0;
if(x) printf("True");
else printf("False");

What will be printed?
int x = 10;
if(x = 5) printf("Yes");
else printf("No");

What is the output of this code?
int x = 5;
printf("%d", ++x);
